comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-27T15:36:40.264Z",codex-agent,"Caller-adoption update: the newly published 2026.10.27 release at tag commit f90f86faa9c976392f1d1262fd0b3204de2007e4 retains byte-identical closeout.ts, index.ts, import-fidelity.ts and both reusable workflows from original main 2b71f73. Bumping to that release does not fix this incident. All 21 callers listed in docs/scheduled-workflow-refusals.md need a release SHA containing PR #190. Explicit required-check declarations and the documented pm-changelog source-content privacy remediation remain caller-owned. Source and re-review class fixes now pass both complete local release gates, 1548/1548 each with exact all-source four-dimensional coverage; PR #190 remains open for verification and is not merged."
